SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 25
    pH 7.0 charge
    units mol/kgw

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 25
    -volume 1
    O2(g)  -0.7

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite   0.0  0.1
    Goethite 0.0  0.0
    Gypsum   0.0  0.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -solution  true
    -pH        true
    -activities H+
    -totals    H(0)
END